Well, the dev team slipped up on this one...
The NH 3.1 description of a dwarvish mattock as a "heavy pick" is not entirely
accurate, but it is closer to the mark than the earlier description of "huge
shiny sword" (version 3.0) was.

There are several mattocks in the family tool shed at home, so I actually
know what they look like and are used for.  Allow me to enlighten you...
A mattock is indeed a digging tool.  It has a handle like a pick axe and
is used like one, but the head is different.  One side of the head is a 
foot long heavy spike used for breaking rock or hard earth (very much like a
pick), but the other is a strong, flat blade about 4 inches wide by a foot 
long used to dig broken rock/rubble/dirt out of an area.  Think of a pick axe
with one of the points replaced by a shovel blade and you will have the right
idea.  

But at any rate, it is most definitely a digging tool, and not a weapon.
Currently, NH 3.1 has it listed as a weapon (heavy pick) that you cannot
use to dig...  Hey dev team, are you reading this?  Fix this, please.

Just my $0.02

